        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1944 年 5 月 11 日中国远征军自保山强渡怒江，西线经腾冲、龙陵，1945 年 1 月 27 日与驻印军在畹町、芒友会师。原线起点距保山 17.8 公里，现由「远征军自保山强渡怒江」事件承接。",
          "en": "On 11 May 1944 the Chinese expeditionary force crossed the Salween from Baoshan; on the western axis it fought through Tengchong and Longling and on 27 January 1945 linked with the India-based force at Wanding and Mangyou. The former start lay 17.8 km from Baoshan; the crossing event now supplies it."
