          "en": "On 4 June 1944 the Chinese expeditionary force attacked Songshan from the Baoshan direction and destroyed its garrison by 7 September. The former start lay east of Baoshan without a precedent; it is now Baoshan–Songshan, anchored by the Salween crossing and Songshan battle events."
